WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.950
Step 1. Open the public workspace and load the starter library
or select an existing script.

00:03.000 --> 00:05.950
Step 2. Explore scenes, switch modus operandi,
and highlight activities with the role pills.

00:06.000 --> 00:08.950
Step 3. Select Edit script to change script details,
scenes, and activities.

00:09.000 --> 00:11.950
Step 4. Open Generate with LLM and describe
the language, topic, region, detail level, and sources.

00:12.000 --> 00:14.950
Step 5. Review the generated prompt
and copy it to an LLM of your choice.

00:15.000 --> 00:17.950
Step 6. Paste only the JSON response back into PAX.
PAX processes and validates it locally.

00:18.000 --> 00:24.000
Step 7. Review scenes, taxonomy, and sources.
Import only after a substantive review.
